*.pdf
*.jpg
*.pyc
logs/*.csv
*.log
# Model checkpoints are not committed, with one exception: the discriminator's
# trained head (0.5 MB) is part of the artifact. Without it a clone has no
# discriminator and E2 cannot run. The frozen CLIP encoder it attaches to is
# fetched by clip.load at runtime, so only the head lives here.
*.pt
!discriminator/CLIP_discriminator_head.pt
.DS_Store
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb
__pycache__/
*gurobi.lic*
